Error [jet.UnknownArgumentLabel]: `ProcessSpec.keep_open` has no parameter labelled `slot`
  --> tests/ui/process_keep_open_label_unknown.jet:6:48
    |
  6 |     _: process.cmd(["true"]).keep_open(reader, slot: 9)
    |                                                ^^^^
 Why: A label binds an argument to the parameter of that name
 Fix: Pass the handle without a label, then the slot as `at:`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0764
